/T (Fuel-price data is difficult to compare when records span multiple countries, dates, fuel types, taxation levels, subsidy categories and crude-oil prices. This project organizes these variables into Tableau worksheets, a consolidated dashboard and a Tableau Story. The dashboard supports exploration; the Story arranges the analysis into a guided sequence. The supporting website introduces the project and can link viewers to published outputs.)
/E (Fuel-price data is difficult to compare when records span multiple countries, dates, fuel types, taxation levels, subsidy categories and crude-oil prices. This project organizes these variables into Tableau worksheets, a consolidated dashboard and a Tableau Story. The dashboard supports exploration; the Story arranges the analysis into a guided sequence. The supporting website introduces the project and can link viewers to published outputs.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
