195 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 90 0 R
/T (The project analyzes global petrol, diesel and LPG prices alongside Brent crude-oil prices, tax percentage, subsidy level, region and income level. Tableau is used to create country comparisons, trend charts and related views, then combine them into a dashboard and a Story for interpretation. A Flask-based website built with HTML, CSS and Bootstrap serves as a supporting project page.)
/E (The project analyzes global petrol, diesel and LPG prices alongside Brent crude-oil prices, tax percentage, subsidy level, region and income level. Tableau is used to create country comparisons, trend charts and related views, then combine them into a dashboard and a Story for interpretation. A Flask-based website built with HTML, CSS and Bootstrap serves as a supporting project page.)
