1062 0 obj
<<
/Title (implementation, testing approach, results, limitations and future scope. The project uses a structured fuel-price dataset and Tableau visualizations to make cross-country and time-based comparisons easier to interpret. A supporting Flask website provides a project presentation layer.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 873 0 R
/Prev 986 0 R
/First 1140 0 R
/Last 1141 0 R
/Count -3
/Next 987 0 R
>>
endobj
1063 0 obj
<<
/Title (Fuel-price data is difficult to compare when records span multiple countries, dates, fuel types, taxation levels, subsidy categories and crude-oil prices. This project organizes these variables into Tableau worksheets, a consolidated dashboard and a Tableau Story. The dashboard supports exploration; the Story arranges the analysis into a guided sequence. The supporting website introduces the project and can link viewers to published outputs.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 987 0 R
/Next 1142 0 R
>>
endobj
1064 0 obj
<<
